  fullText: 'I am the only one left. All water is nearly gone.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    \n\nI have prepared a capsule that should hopefully maintain my body\nintact
    for a very long time. It is unlikely that anyone will find us down\nhere, but
    it is the only thing I can think of.                                                                                           
    \n\nThis is simply sad. A sad way to go.                                                                                                                                                                                        '
